#. ID 1, Page 1, Line 2, Pos (6,4)
msgid ""
"Add -100 (Var 4) HP to Alex.\n"
"Kill not possible."
msgstr ""
"Ajout de -100 (Var 4) PV à Alex.\n"
"Mort non possible."

